== o7_level3 ==
L1  Pi = (2/3)(U + U^T): idempotent, symmetric, trace 4, commuting with U; U orthogonal: True
L2  U + U^T = (3/2) on V and 0 on its complement: True  (2 cos theta = 3/2: not an integer, infinite order)
L3  Lie algebra L generated by the 720 permutation conjugates of Y: dimension 10 (so(6): 15); every conjugate annihilates the all-ones vector: True
L3' algebra L' generated by Y under Ad(M1), Ad(M1^T), Ad(adjacent transpositions) and brackets: dimension 15
L4  Ad(D)(E_01 - E_10) has entries (1j, 1j) at (0,1), (1,0): i(E_01 + E_10), outside so(6): True
CC  so(5)-type generator: dimension 10; level two: U + U^T annihilated by a product of (S - c), c integer in [-2, 2]: True

-- countercontrols (must be False)
CC1  CC-OK (False as required)
CC2  CC-OK (False as required)
CC3  CC-OK (False as required)  (dimension 10)

VERDICT LEVEL3-DENSE: at level three the closure of <mixImage 3 (pi/4), permutations> contains SO(6) (O(6) with
  the odd permutations), and with the quarter phase on one column it contains SU(6): dense unitary control up to
  phase at level three at the balanced angle, without exactness (a countable group).
